WEBVTT

00:01.401 --> 00:03.801
Her name is Punie Tanaka.

00:03.937 --> 00:06.599
She's a princess
from the land of magic.

00:06.706 --> 00:11.973
She's currently going through with her
earthly trials. Good luck, Punie-chan!

00:20.687 --> 00:23.781
<i>Magical Witch Punie- chan</i>

00:23.957 --> 00:26.892
<i>Spin that Princess Rod.</i>

00:27.193 --> 00:30.128
<i>She has descended
from the land of magic.</i>

00:30.463 --> 00:33.591
<i>Spin that magical stick.</i>

00:33.700 --> 00:36.692
<i>Pleased to meet you, Punie Tanaka.</i>

00:36.936 --> 00:43.364
<i>Lightning, sweep, exterminate,
use your powers and rule the world.</i>

00:43.510 --> 00:48.311
<i>Don't trust those kind
words and nice smiles.</i>

00:51.718 --> 00:57.486
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

00:57.791 --> 01:04.424
<i>I will take you to the land of paradise.</i>

01:04.664 --> 01:10.762
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

01:10.870 --> 01:19.676
<i>There's only one way
to survive, and that is to fight.</i>

01:27.253 --> 01:38.289
<i>There's only one path that leads
to supremacy, and that is by fighting.</i>

01:42.102 --> 01:44.070
<i>Railroad Journal</i>

01:45.305 --> 01:47.637
Good morning, Tetsuko-chan!

01:50.743 --> 01:52.142
Morning, Punie-chan.

01:52.245 --> 01:53.813
We'll be late if we don't hurry.

01:53.813 --> 01:55.974
We'll be late if we don't hurry.
You're right.

01:56.282 --> 02:00.013
Dr. Yellow's HO is a limited edition.

02:00.820 --> 02:02.617
<i>Handmade Noodles</i>

02:08.828 --> 02:09.954
What's wrong?

02:28.114 --> 02:29.775
Ouch!

02:30.250 --> 02:32.047
Tetsuko-chan, you okay?

02:32.152 --> 02:34.985
This is horrible. Who'd make a pitfall?

02:35.488 --> 02:38.082
You poor thing. I'll help you right away.

02:42.495 --> 02:45.191
Think of that as my greeting, Punie.

02:46.065 --> 02:48.397
<i>Episode 3:
Shocking Breakfast Strategy!?</i>

02:48.501 --> 02:51.026
<i>If a Little Cuckoo
Doesn't Chirp, Kill It!!</i>

02:51.571 --> 02:52.970
A pitfall?

02:53.072 --> 02:54.972
That's unfortunate.

02:55.241 --> 02:57.402
That's right. I'm angry.

02:57.510 --> 02:59.603
Well, you should be careful.

02:59.712 --> 03:03.705
There are a lot of people who
hate your guts, including me.

03:04.050 --> 03:06.018
Next up is Tanaka!

03:06.553 --> 03:07.542
Right!

03:09.956 --> 03:11.184
Here I go!

03:18.264 --> 03:19.492
Tetsuko-chan.

03:20.233 --> 03:22.428
Can you go ahead of me?

03:22.835 --> 03:23.859
Sure.

03:24.504 --> 03:27.098
Tetsuko Koku is going instead!

03:28.241 --> 03:31.540
From Shinbashi with
the sound of a whistle...

03:34.180 --> 03:37.479
...our fast train leaves the station.

03:39.686 --> 03:42.985
With the mountain
of Atago within sight...

03:44.924 --> 03:49.224
...you embark on a journey
with the moon as your friend. There!

04:06.145 --> 04:07.840
This huge pitfall...

04:10.350 --> 04:11.284
Could it be...

04:11.284 --> 04:12.285
Could it be...
You avoided it nicely, Punie.

04:12.285 --> 04:13.980
You avoided it nicely, Punie.

04:14.621 --> 04:15.713
You!

04:15.822 --> 04:17.881
But your luck's run out.

04:18.291 --> 04:20.486
I'm here to take your life!

04:21.561 --> 04:24.496
Hole-digger Ellie.
So it was you all along.

04:24.731 --> 04:27.666
My name is Elise von Barbaroque.

04:27.767 --> 04:32.067
Don't ever call me that again!
Give me the right of succession!

04:32.372 --> 04:33.634
Punie-chan.

04:33.740 --> 04:37.437
Succession? Is she
an assassin from the land of magic?

04:37.710 --> 04:41.339
Royal authority is sacred.
I can't give it to you.

04:42.148 --> 04:43.775
As I expected.

04:43.883 --> 04:46.784
Then die by viper fangs!

04:46.886 --> 04:49.047
Tekerettsu paa!

04:51.257 --> 04:54.317
Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all!

04:54.427 --> 04:56.190
Mongooses, appear!

04:59.232 --> 05:01.530
Those mongooses are so cute!

05:13.713 --> 05:16.341
Looks like we can't
settle it with magic.

05:19.385 --> 05:20.852
Then...

05:29.395 --> 05:31.727
We'll have to use physical attacks!

05:50.750 --> 05:52.342
She got behind Punie!

05:52.452 --> 05:53.419
Punie-chan!

06:04.297 --> 06:05.730
She did it.

06:27.053 --> 06:32.150
Punie is good. Every one of
her moves can take me down.

06:32.258 --> 06:37.286
If she gets a good grip, my joints
will be bent in awkward directions!

06:40.032 --> 06:43.866
Amazing... That lady
is fighting toe to toe with Punie.

06:43.970 --> 06:46.200
Come on, Punie-chan!

06:47.807 --> 06:50.742
But your perfection
is your greatest weakness.

06:50.843 --> 06:52.367
That's where I'll strike!

06:56.182 --> 06:57.116
She got her!

06:57.116 --> 06:59.141
She got her!
You fell for it!

06:59.652 --> 07:00.641
A dummy!

07:09.061 --> 07:13.828
Those cuffs have the magic-inhibiting
mark of the evil god Anisakis.

07:14.100 --> 07:18.764
Looks like you can't use your magic
or your submission holds, Punie.

07:20.973 --> 07:22.031
Stop!

07:24.811 --> 07:27.177
Why are you doing
such a cruel thing?

07:27.280 --> 07:29.748
It's not right to take
the throne by force!

07:31.818 --> 07:33.945
This isn't right?

07:34.754 --> 07:36.312
You've misunderstood!

07:36.422 --> 07:39.880
The Tanaka family is
the one who usurped the throne!

07:43.463 --> 07:48.560
My father, King Barbaroque, was
a wise monarch loved by his people.

07:59.512 --> 08:00.638
But...

08:01.180 --> 08:03.182
<i>Suspicious empire</i>

08:03.182 --> 08:06.151
<i>Rise and revolt!
Overthrow the traitor!</i>

08:25.238 --> 08:30.073
We were cast out thanks to Punie's
mother, Esmeralda, and her dirty plan.

08:35.081 --> 08:39.575
I should've been the princess
of Saint Magical Kingdom!

08:40.887 --> 08:43.185
What? That can't be!

08:43.890 --> 08:46.654
Punie-chan, say something!

08:48.895 --> 08:52.160
Your father was incompetent,
so he was overthrown.

08:52.498 --> 08:53.366
What?

08:53.366 --> 08:54.663
What?
Punie-chan!

08:55.034 --> 08:57.559
As a matter of fact,
you should be grateful.

08:57.670 --> 09:00.662
Since he was
thrown out instead of beheaded.

09:02.742 --> 09:08.237
The king was incompetent, so he's
having a hard time getting a job.

09:09.081 --> 09:11.982
He goes to the Hello Work
hiring office daily...

09:12.084 --> 09:14.882
...and Mother does housework
and makes fake flowers.

09:14.987 --> 09:19.890
We're in such needy circumstances,
and our lives are like hell itself.

09:21.394 --> 09:24.557
Now it's your family's turn to suffer!

09:31.837 --> 09:33.236
Not good, not good.

09:33.339 --> 09:35.330
Punie's in big trouble!

09:35.441 --> 09:37.375
What should I do? What should I do?

09:37.476 --> 09:39.637
Please calm down, honey.

09:39.745 --> 09:41.337
Yes, but...

09:42.048 --> 09:44.812
If she has trouble
defeating such a foe...

09:44.917 --> 09:47.852
...then she's unworthy
of being my successor.

09:58.331 --> 09:59.298
Die!

10:08.040 --> 10:11.305
Did you think
handcuffs could restrain me?

10:11.677 --> 10:12.701
Shut up!

10:12.812 --> 10:15.372
Princess Capoeira Kick!

10:20.186 --> 10:23.781
You've misunderstood
the meaning of a legitimate monarch.

10:23.889 --> 10:26.619
You have to claim
the throne with power!

10:27.393 --> 10:30.829
Shut your mouth, little girl!
You're still handcuffed, you know!

10:31.263 --> 10:33.925
So you think it's
over if I'm handcuffed?

10:34.533 --> 10:35.693
Silly.

10:36.002 --> 10:39.938
Such a thing in the 4,000-year
history of submission holds...

10:59.191 --> 11:00.556
It's over.

11:00.860 --> 11:02.589
I assumed I'd win.

11:04.930 --> 11:07.899
Princess Figure-four Leglock!

11:10.102 --> 11:12.627
If I can just reverse this move...

11:23.182 --> 11:25.241
Princess STF!

11:26.786 --> 11:29.380
Princess Reverse Armbar!

11:30.790 --> 11:33.122
Princess Prison Break.

11:34.527 --> 11:37.018
Princess Chicken-wing Facelock!

11:38.164 --> 11:40.325
Princess Monji Lock!

11:51.544 --> 11:55.878
She might've been
better off getting hurt by magic...

11:56.048 --> 11:58.175
She's such a vicious woman.

11:58.818 --> 12:01.184
Did I do too much? Oops.

12:01.287 --> 12:03.255
What do you mean "oops"?

12:04.724 --> 12:06.089
<i>Episode 4:</i>

12:06.192 --> 12:09.684
<i>Oh, So Cute! Did You Know the
Chances of Having Twins Are 1/120?</i>

12:14.433 --> 12:15.167
Hey.

12:15.167 --> 12:16.395
Hey.
You there.

12:17.937 --> 12:22.271
The old lady with the aging skin.
Do you know this person?

12:22.908 --> 12:25.433
Me? Are you talking about me?

12:25.544 --> 12:28.012
Who else would it be?

12:28.114 --> 12:31.379
There's only one person
here with aging skin...

12:31.484 --> 12:34.282
...and a lifeless, stiff face, old lady.

12:34.386 --> 12:35.614
Old lady.

12:37.823 --> 12:40.053
Oh, that's Punie-chan.

12:40.159 --> 12:42.150
She's our friend.

12:42.495 --> 12:46.329
Oh, you old ladies
are friends with our sister?

12:47.266 --> 12:50.861
I'm surprised that
the brute actually has friends!

12:50.970 --> 12:53.996
Are you two
Punie-chan's younger sisters?

12:54.273 --> 12:56.008
Her younger sister, Pyun Tanaka.

12:56.008 --> 12:58.306
Her younger sister, Pyun Tanaka.
And Potaru Tanaka.

12:58.978 --> 13:01.105
Remember our names, idiots!

13:02.081 --> 13:06.575
They're definitely Punie's sisters.
What vicious powers do they have...

13:07.186 --> 13:10.178
Hurry up and take us to our sister.

13:10.289 --> 13:13.554
Did you hear us,
you idiot-faced blockhead?

13:13.926 --> 13:16.486
If I go easy, they'll beat me.

13:16.595 --> 13:19.758
You brats!
You'd better watch what you say!

13:19.865 --> 13:22.095
Ouch! It hurts!

13:22.201 --> 13:23.634
That's terrible!

13:23.736 --> 13:25.829
What are you doing, Anego-san?

13:25.938 --> 13:28.133
What the hell? They're so weak.

13:28.841 --> 13:32.106
I'll get revenge on Punie
by taking it out on them.

13:34.013 --> 13:35.173
Big Sister!

13:35.281 --> 13:36.509
Pyun! Potaru!

13:36.916 --> 13:38.474
Big Sister!

13:38.784 --> 13:40.718
Pyun! Potaru!

13:41.620 --> 13:45.454
They haven't seen each other in
so long. Get yourselves pampered.

13:51.931 --> 13:55.992
Hand over the right of succession
to us, you rotten witch!

13:56.101 --> 13:57.625
You evil witch!

13:57.736 --> 14:01.502
That's why you came to Earth?
You don't know when to quit.

14:01.774 --> 14:04.368
Payatan and
Hole-digger Ellie were the same.

14:04.476 --> 14:09.470
Why does everyone from the land
of magic want to kill Punie-chan?

14:11.116 --> 14:13.778
The right of succession aside...

14:16.021 --> 14:18.190
Don't use sharp objects in the streets!

14:18.190 --> 14:19.919
Don't use sharp objects in the streets!
We're sorry!

14:20.459 --> 14:24.418
I have to go to school, so stay
at the Punie house and behave.

14:24.530 --> 14:26.054
Okay...

14:31.170 --> 14:35.197
That's not like you.
Letting them go after a spanking.

14:35.307 --> 14:36.740
Oh, really?

14:37.142 --> 14:42.205
It was too easy. They say even lions
are serious when hunting rabbits.

14:43.649 --> 14:45.947
Of course I'm serious...

14:46.051 --> 14:47.450
...when I hunt.

14:47.720 --> 14:50.086
Like I thought. You're vicious, Punie.

14:54.093 --> 14:58.029
We came for her head,
but we ended up really embarrassed.

14:58.130 --> 15:01.998
We won't let her get away
with this! That goby witch!

15:09.575 --> 15:11.236
I'm Payatan!

15:11.343 --> 15:13.504
Hey, fake mammal!

15:13.879 --> 15:16.006
Come here for a second.

15:16.715 --> 15:18.706
What is it, paya?

15:18.951 --> 15:21.943
Are you giving me
something good to eat, paya?

15:23.555 --> 15:26.956
We're the only ones here, Payatan.

15:27.593 --> 15:30.926
Or should I say
Colonel Paya Livingston?

15:33.966 --> 15:36.025
What is this about?

15:36.568 --> 15:39.969
Abandon our sister
and become our mascot.

15:40.072 --> 15:42.540
We'll guarantee you'll succeed in life.

15:42.641 --> 15:45.633
Oh, jeez. Not that story again...

15:52.885 --> 15:57.151
Come up with a better story next time.

15:59.525 --> 16:00.526
See you.

16:00.526 --> 16:01.493
See you.
Wait!

16:01.860 --> 16:05.227
You think you can get away
by turning your back to us?

16:05.831 --> 16:08.026
Listen, little girls.

16:08.133 --> 16:10.465
Punie might be nice to you...

16:11.670 --> 16:13.831
...but I'm not nice at all.

16:13.939 --> 16:16.931
A pet with a bad mouth like that.

16:17.042 --> 16:18.771
I'm disappointed, Potaru.

16:18.877 --> 16:22.711
You're right, Pyun.
I thought he'd make a good mascot.

16:23.749 --> 16:25.808
Let's go find another one.

16:27.619 --> 16:29.917
Those rings! Don't tell me...

16:32.024 --> 16:34.857
S-Stop!

16:39.031 --> 16:42.159
They're foul-mouthed,
but your sisters are cute.

16:42.267 --> 16:46.101
Right. They're much younger,
so I adore them very much.

16:46.205 --> 16:48.105
I end up pampering them.

16:48.207 --> 16:49.231
Let's go!

16:52.945 --> 16:55.607
I heard the sound of a carriage.

16:58.350 --> 16:59.374
Let's go!

17:03.822 --> 17:05.050
Payatan!

17:05.157 --> 17:08.217
P-Punie-sama, be careful...

17:09.061 --> 17:10.323
Payatan...

17:10.929 --> 17:12.954
Those girls...

17:13.732 --> 17:16.257
Those girls have in their hands...

17:25.344 --> 17:26.333
Payatan!

17:39.558 --> 17:41.617
Pyun... Potaru...

17:43.162 --> 17:45.653
I think I'm a little angry now.

17:45.964 --> 17:48.228
We're already angry.

17:48.333 --> 17:51.268
You embarrassed us
so many times in the past.

17:51.570 --> 17:54.471
We can't go on
without getting our revenge!

17:55.174 --> 17:58.701
That's the royal family's
class-A magic equipment...

17:58.811 --> 18:01.439
The Ring of the Immoral!

18:01.980 --> 18:05.711
Lyrical Tokarev, destroy everything!

18:15.127 --> 18:16.822
What happened?

18:20.566 --> 18:23.535
I am Zephel Yetzler.

18:23.769 --> 18:26.431
A wandering soul with no master.

18:26.972 --> 18:28.599
He's trouble, paya...

18:28.707 --> 18:32.939
He's one of the oldest gods
from before mythical times...

18:33.345 --> 18:35.939
He's unbelievably strong, paya...

18:52.297 --> 18:53.457
What now?

18:53.565 --> 18:56.693
Magic is ineffective
against a god, idiot.

18:56.802 --> 19:02.297
Since he's that big, you can't use
your submission holds, loser.

19:02.641 --> 19:06.475
Give us the right of succession
and we'll spare you, filthy punk.

19:06.578 --> 19:10.708
On your knees.
Cry and beg for your life, you bitch.

19:11.617 --> 19:13.517
That's all you have to say?

19:13.619 --> 19:14.711
What?

19:15.220 --> 19:18.087
Say everything you're thinking.

19:18.190 --> 19:20.886
Because they'll be your last words.

19:22.161 --> 19:26.154
Pyun, don't hesitate.
This is one of her usual dirty tricks.

19:26.265 --> 19:28.699
She can't possibly win against a god.

19:28.800 --> 19:30.392
Yeah, you're right.

19:31.203 --> 19:34.366
Zephel, get rid of that insidious witch!

19:49.755 --> 19:51.347
I told you before.

19:51.456 --> 19:54.323
A champion uses submission holds.

19:57.396 --> 19:58.829
He did it!

20:00.866 --> 20:04.199
There's no submission
hold that won't work!

20:06.438 --> 20:09.407
Princess Figure-four Fingerlock!

20:15.414 --> 20:16.472
Give up?

20:16.582 --> 20:18.948
No! No!

20:19.051 --> 20:20.541
Come on!

20:29.628 --> 20:32.188
You're that witch from back then!

20:32.297 --> 20:35.061
Long time no see, Zephel Yetzler.

20:38.103 --> 20:40.298
Spare me!

20:42.941 --> 20:48.072
Punie-chan,
what did you do to that god?

20:49.314 --> 20:50.281
Now...

20:53.085 --> 20:55.178
Pyun, Potaru...

20:55.287 --> 21:00.987
If you do this again, I'll keep applying
submission holds again and again...

21:01.526 --> 21:04.154
...till your flesh and bones turn to dust.

21:04.263 --> 21:05.821
We're sorry!

21:06.164 --> 21:09.565
As long as you understand.
I'll make you some pancakes.

21:09.635 --> 21:12.536
Yay! Yay! Yay!

21:12.838 --> 21:15.363
I really like your pancakes!

21:15.474 --> 21:16.634
And honey?

21:16.742 --> 21:19.233
Of course. I'll pour plenty of it.

21:19.344 --> 21:20.242
Yay!

21:20.345 --> 21:23.007
Fear the land of magic...

21:29.688 --> 21:33.647
You're getting closer to becoming
a weak character like me.

21:53.412 --> 22:01.251
<i>If you bend the knees upside down...</i>

22:01.520 --> 22:08.858
<i>...even your belief about
crushing a rock becomes distorted.</i>

22:09.528 --> 22:17.025
<i>Good, justice, and even the truth
is gone when you feel the pain.</i>

22:17.135 --> 22:25.543
<i>Even those with fortitude have joints.</i>

22:25.677 --> 22:33.550
<i>Take a look. This is
the submission of a monarch.</i>

22:33.752 --> 22:46.222
<i>As long as you
have fortitude, you will prosper.</i>

23:06.685 --> 23:10.018
Next, "Can You Decide
Someone's Value with Test Scores?"

23:10.122 --> 23:12.989
"I'm Probably a Zero Anyway.
That's Right."

23:13.091 --> 23:16.185
"When I Saw You Sweep Back
Your Bangs Under the Apple Tree...

23:16.294 --> 23:21.129
...with the Flower-comb in Your Hair,
I Thought You Were a Flower Too."
